From 1ce81ca2f9f8985e82f5d55c0e78a428ec6174e2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cognava <dev@samuhia.co.ke>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 08:39:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] SMS: short invoice links on plot.samuhia.co.ke/i/<code>

- SMS invoice, overdue and payment messages now carry a ~35 char link instead of the long Firebase URL
- Credit-aware: compact wording is tried first; the link is skipped if it would add credits beyond the budget
  (0 extra credits for the flat-1-credit SMS-only path, max 1 for the metered path)
- invoiceLink function (africa-south1) + Hosting rewrite /i/**: redirects to the invoice's current PDF,
  Storage-only targets, noindex, click counter; service worker bypasses /i/
- shortLinks / shortLinkIndex Firestore collections, links reused per invoice
- Unit tests in whatsapp/src/shortLink.spec.ts
